steam/apps/1235100/extras/af7fa858cfd2008d1d4b5a152ae869c9.mp4?t=1786974560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you meet the spirits that guard Rolling Hills, you'll lift the town out of obscurity and gain access to otherworldly challenges with unique rewards, like an underwater restaurant!</p>", "short_description": "Manage your own sushi restaurant! Collect and upgrade dishes, personalize your dining room, and use special abilities to serve customers in a dash.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“A must-play for fans of cozy and restaurant management-style gameplay.”<br>9/10 – BonusAction<br><br>“Rolling Hills is as satisfying as great sushi. You’ll have fun running a restaurant and making friends at a nice pace with very little to stop you.”<br>8.5/10 – GameGrin<br><br>“Its charm lies in its simplicity. It’s a delightful escape from the everyday hustle, offering a chance to unwind and immerse yourself in a world of good food and warm friendships.”<br>Games Reviews<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235100/header.jpg?t=1786974560", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786974560", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1235100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786974560", "website": "http://visitrollinghills.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.2GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l